# visualization/vcf-stats-out/ and visualization/viz-data/ are deliberately
# tracked (not ignored), unlike every other output dir above — they're
# small (a few MB total for all 4 samples) and are the actual dashboard
# input data (CW_viz_pipeline, local machine), so committing them lets
# git history double as a before/after record across pipeline changes
# (e.g. the 2026-09-19 fastp adapter-trimming addition) instead of losing
# that comparison the moment new output overwrites old.

output-id/*

# Analyses: results live under $OUTPUTS (outside the repo); the output/ symlink
# and log/ folders are local only. Run manifests are tracked.
analyses/*/output/
analyses/*/log/
!analyses/*/manifests/

